  "reference": "Mwandzo 27",
  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati Isaka kala ni mtumia na matsoge tagaona tsona, wamuiha Esau, mwanawe mvyere, achimuamba, “Mwanangu.” Esau waihika, “Hee!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka achimuamba, “Lola, mino ndipho ni mtumia na siku zangu za kufwa sizimanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi, phahi, hala uhao na ryakaro, uphiye weruni ukaniindzire nyama wa weruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu unitengezere chakurya cha mtswano chira nchimendzacho, unirehere nirye ili nikujaliye kabila sidzangbwefwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbavi, Isaka ariphokala anabisha na mwanawe Esau, Rebeka kala anaphundza. Esau ariphouka kuphiya windzani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rebeka wamuambira mwanawe Jakobo, “Nkasikira sowe anamuamba mwenenu Esau, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Kaniindzire nyama wa weruni, unijitire chakurya cha mtswano nirye, ili nikujaliye mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu kabila sidzangbwefwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi, mwanangu, niphundza na uhende vira ndivyokulagiza: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phiya chaani na ukatsambule mvarika airi anono, nimjitire sowe chakurya cha mtswano, dza amendzavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu undamphirikira sowe akarye, ili akujaliye kabila kadzangbwefwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo achimuamba nine, “Lola, mwenehu Esau ana malalaika na mino sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chahi baba andaniphaphasa na andaona kukala namchenga; hipho naweza kudzipha lana badala ya baraka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nine achimuamba, “Mwanangu, lana iyo nainigbwire mimi, henda nikulagizavyo tu, phiya ukanirehere zo mbuzi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Jakobo wakpwendazihala na achimrehera nine, naye achitengeza chakurya cha mtswano, kama ise amendzavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu Rebeka achihala nguwo nono kabisa za Esau mwanawe mvyere, ambazo kala anazo nyumbani, achimvwika Jakobo, mwanawe mdide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya wamvwika chingo za zira mbuzi mikononi na singoni ambamo kala tamuna malalaika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu achimupha Jakobo chira chakurya cha mtswano na mabofulo gokala akagaocha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Jakobo achiphiya kpwa ise na achimuiha, “Baba.” Ise achiihika, “Hee! Ni mwanangu yuphi ye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo achimuambira ise, “Ni mimi Esau, mwanao mvyere. Nkahenda kama uchivyoniambira. Tafadhali baba, sagalato urye nyama zangu za windzani ili unibariki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka achimuuza mwanawe, “Ikakaladze rero mwanangu, hata ukaphaha nyama mara mwenga?” Achimuambira ise, “Ni kpwa sababu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo akaniterya kuphaha nyama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Isaka achimuambira Jakobo, “Ndzo phephi, mwanangu nikuphaphase ili nihakikishe napho u Esau kpweli au siwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakobo wamsengerera ise naye achimphaphasa, na achiamba, “Raka ni raka ra Jakobo, ela mikono ni ya Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamanyire kukala ni Jakobo mana mikonoye kala ina malalaika dza ga nduguye Esau. Phokala a phephi na kumjaliya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamuuza tsona, “We u Esau kpweli?” Achiamba, “Ee, ni mimi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu achimuambira, “Mwanangu nirehera hizo nyamazo za windzani nirye, ili nikubariki.” Jakobo wamupha ise chakurya achirya, na achimupha uchi achinwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ise achiamba, “Ndzo mwanangu unidonere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
