          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Rebeka wamuambira Isaka, “Nasikira kusinywa sana mwangu moyoni kpwa sababu ya hano achetu a Chihiti. Ichikala Jakobo andalóla mchetu kula tsi ihi, yani Muhiti dza aha, phahi baha nifwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.46"
            ]
          }
        }
